              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aso nakejarunia kotoma okatwak, kiitut ikekesisiak ebe enerit ŋun; kiyuut nakiwadikatai ka akirot da nakinera Yesu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.22",
